\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"See your take-home pay after all taxes\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L12\\\",\\\"/tax-refund-calculator\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/tax-refund-calculator\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg p-2 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"💰\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Tax Refund Calculator\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Estimate your 2025 tax refund\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L12\\\",\\\"/irs-withholding-calculator\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/irs-withholding-calculator\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg p-2 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"📋\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"IRS Withholding Calculator\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Optimize your W-4 for 2026\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L12\\\",\\\"/self-employment-tax-calculator\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/self-employment-tax-calculator\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg p-2 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"🛡️\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Self-Employment Calculator\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"15.3% SE tax + quarterly estimates\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"35:T44d,A lot of people don't realize you can also \\u003cstrong\\u003efile a free tax extension\\u003c/strong\\u003e through IRS Free File. Form 4868 gives you until October 15 to file your return — but you still have to pay what you owe by April 15. The extension is just for the paperwork, not the payment. Free File partners let you e-file Form 4868 for free. If you're owed a refund, there's no penalty for filing late, but getting that money sooner is always better. For detailed IRS rules, check the \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.irs.gov/e-file-providers/irs-free-file-program-for-online-tax-preparation\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eofficial IRS Free File page\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003cbr/\\u003e\\u003cbr/\\u003eKey things to know:\\u003cbr/\\u003e- IRS Free File opens in late January each year\\u003cbr/\\u003e- Your AGI threshold is $84,000 for Guided Preparation (2026 filing season)\\u003cbr/\\u003e- Free File Fillable Forms have no income limit\\u003cbr/\\u003e- Active-duty military with AGI ≤ $84,000 get free state filing too\\u003cbr/\\u003e- Seniors (57+) and low-income taxpayers may have additional free options through VITA/TCE\\u003cbr/\\u003e- You can file Form 4868 (extension) for free through IRS Free File\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"32:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12 space-y-10\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-6 sm:p-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How IRS Free File Works — Complete Guide\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"IRS Free File is a partnership between the IRS and private tax software companies. If your adjusted gross income (AGI) is $84,000 or less for the 2025 tax year (filed in 2026), you qualify for \\u003cstrong\\u003eGuided Tax Preparation\\u003c/strong\\u003e — that's brand-name software like TaxSlayer, OLT, or FreeTaxUSA walking you through your return step by step, asking you questions and doing the math for you. No charge for the federal return. Some partners also include free state filing, though that varies. The whole thing runs through \\u003ca href=\\\\\\\"https://apps.irs.gov/app/freeFile\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" rel=\\\\\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\\\\\"\\u003eirs.gov/freefile\\u003c/a\\u003e — you pick a partner, create an account on their site, and file. The IRS doesn't see your data until you hit submit.\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"If your AGI is over $84,000, or you're comfortable doing your own taxes without hand-holding, \\u003cstrong\\u003eFree File Fillable Forms\\u003c/strong\\u003e are the other option. These are electronic versions of IRS paper forms — Form 1040, Schedule A, Schedule C, Schedule SE, and dozens more. No income limit, no age restriction. You type in the numbers, the forms do basic math, and you e-file directly. It's free. The tradeoff: you're on your own. No interview process, no \\\\\\\"did you forget about this deduction?\\\\\\\" prompts. If you know what forms you need and how to fill them out, it's fantastic. If you're new to taxes, stick with Guided Preparation.\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$35\\\"}}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-6 sm:p-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How to File Your Taxes for Free with IRS Free File — Step by Step\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$L36\\\",\\\"$L37\\\",\\\"$L38\\\",\\\"$L39\\\",\\\"$L3a\\\",\\\"$L3b\\\"]}]]}],\\\"$L3c\\\",\\\"$L3d\\\",\\\"$L3e\\\",\\\"$L3f\\\",\\\"$L40\\\",\\\"$L41\\\",\\\"$L42\\\",\\\"$L43\\\",\\\"$L44\\\",\\\"$L45\\\",\\\"$L46\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"50:I[18274,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2g3ofza521d-d.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3mzfoc5k_0lxh.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1h498-er8bjws.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1l_n4bv91w2_0.js\\\"],\\\"LinkToUs\\\"]\\n36:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400\\\",\\\"children\\\":1}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Gather Your Documents\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Collect your W-2(s), 1099(s), last year's tax return (for AGI verification), Social Security numbers for all household members, and bank account info for direct deposit.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n37:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400\\\",\\\"children\\\":2}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Go to irs.gov/freefile\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Always start from the IRS website — going directly to a tax software site may lead you to their paid version. Click \\\\\\\"Choose a Free File Company\\\\\\\" to see available partners.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n38:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400\\\",\\\"children\\\":3}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Pick a Free File Partner\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Browse the list of IRS-approved partners. Each has different features — some support self-employment income, some include free state filing, some are better for itemized deductions. Use the IRS lookup tool to find the best match.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n39:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400\\\",\\\"children\\\":4}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Create an Account \\u0026 Verify\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Sign up on the partner's site. You'll verify your identity using last year's AGI or a self-select PIN. If it's your first time filing, you'll need to mail in a signature form (Form 8453) in some cases.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n3a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400\\\",\\\"children\\\":5}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Complete Your Return\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Follow the guided interview for Guided Preparation, or enter data directly into forms for Fillable Forms. Double-check everything — Social Security numbers, bank details, and math.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n3b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400\\\",\\\"children\\\":6}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"E-File \\u0026 Confirm\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Submit electronically. You'll get an acknowledgment within 24–48 hours confirming the IRS accepted your return. If rejected, the error message tells you what to fix — resubmit for free.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-xl border border-sky-500/20 bg-sky-500/5 p-6 sm:p-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Free File Fillable Forms — No Income Limit\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Free File Fillable Forms are the electronic equivalent of IRS paper forms. There is \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"no income limit\\\"}],\\\"— anyone can use them regardless of how much they earn. The forms include basic math calculations (they add up lines and carry numbers forward), but they don't guide you through the process like paid software would.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Available forms include:\\\"}],\\\" Form 1040, Schedule A (Itemized Deductions), Schedule B (Interest and Dividends), Schedule C (Business Income), Schedule D (Capital Gains), Schedule E (Rental Income), Schedule SE (Self-Employment Tax), Form 8812 (Child Tax Credit), Form 2441 (Child and Dependent Care), and many more.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What's NOT included:\\\"}],\\\" State tax returns (file separately through your state), some less common forms, and any hand-holding. If you need to file Form 2555 (Foreign Earned Income) or Form 1116 (Foreign Tax Credit), check availability first — not all international forms are supported.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Best for:\\\"}],\\\"Taxpayers who know which forms they need, have straightforward returns above the $84,000 AGI threshold, or previously filed with paper forms and want the convenience of e-filing. If you're comfortable reading IRS instructions and filling in the numbers yourself, this is a solid free option.\\\"]}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-6 sm:p-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Free Tax Extension — File Form 4868 for Free\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Can't file by April 15? You can \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"file a free tax extension\\\"}],\\\"through IRS Free File. Form 4868 gives you an automatic 6-month extension until October 15 — no questions asked. Here's the critical distinction:\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 my-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/60 p-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400 mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Extension = More Time to File\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You get until October 15 to submit your completed return. No penalty for late filing.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/60 p-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-red-400 mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"NOT More Time to Pay\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You still owe taxes by April 15. Late payment = 0.5% per month penalty + interest.\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How to file a free extension:\\\"}],\\\" Go