rify current offerings at irs.gov/freefile before starting your return.\"}]]}]]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6\",\"children\":\"IRS Free File FAQ\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"What is IRS Free File and how does it work?\"}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"IRS Free File is a partnership between the IRS and private tax software companies that lets you file your federal tax return for free. If your AGI is $84,000 or less, you can use guided tax software (think TurboTax-style interview process) at no cost. If your income is higher, Free File Fillable Forms — electronic versions of IRS paper forms — are available to everyone. You access both through irs.gov/freefile.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Who qualifies for IRS Free File guided tax preparation?\"}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Anyone with a 2025 adjusted gross income (AGI) of $84,000 or less qualifies for IRS Free File Guided Tax Preparation. That covers roughly 70% of all taxpayers. Active-duty military personnel with AGI ≤ $84,000 also get free state filing. Taxpayers 57 and older may have access to additional partner options. There's no age minimum — you just need to meet the income threshold.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"What are Free File Fillable Forms?\"}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Free File Fillable Forms are electronic versions of IRS paper forms that anyone can use to file their federal taxes for free, regardless of income. They're available at freefilefillableforms.com and include Form 1040, Schedules A through SE, and most other common IRS forms. The forms do basic math calculations, but there's no interview process or guidance — you need to know which forms to fill out and how. There's no income limit, making them the go-to option for taxpayers who earn more than $84,000.\"}]]}],\"$L47\",\"$L48\",\"$L49\",\"$L4a\",\"$L4b\",\"$L4c\",\"$L4d\",\"$L4e\",\"$L4f\"]}]]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-6 sm:p-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"Related Calculators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L12\",\"paycheck-calculator\",{\"href\":\"/paycheck-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3.5 w-3.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6\"}]}],\"Paycheck Calculator\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L12\",\"tax-refund-calculator\",{\"href\":\"/tax-refund-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3.5 w-3.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6\"}]}],\"Tax Refund Calculator\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L12\",\"self-employment-tax-calculator\",{\"href\":\"/self-employment-tax-calculator\",\"cla